      "class": "archival",
      "content": "pubrel 0.5.2 was released on 2026-10-13 from commit f2014176172503d04108028486f69874cfba8a88 with these changes.",
      "data": {
        "columns": [
          {
            "name": "category"
          },
          {
            "name": "change"
          }
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "added",
            "`check` and `tag` follow a key rotation (publet spec Section 10.5): a release signed by a key the release key rotates from verifies, when both keys signed the rotation, so release.json can name a new key without breaking earlier releases"
          ],
          [
            "fixed",
            "`withdraw` no longer discards key objects or the signatures that rotate a key: withdrawing a first release discarded the corpus's key, and the release cut again failed `check` with \"the release key ... is not in objects\""
          ],
          [
            "fixed",
            "A release without a summary of its own is no longer held to the previous release's summary, which the lock keeps and which may be signed by an earlier key"
          ]
        ]
      },
